<title>India: CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND BEAT PAKISTAN IN INDEPENDENCE CUP.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND BEAT PAKISTAN IN INDEPENDENCE CUP.</headline>
<dateline>MOHALI, India 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand beat Pakistan by 22 runs in the opening match of the four-nation Independence Cup cricket tournament on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: New Zealand 285-7 innings (50 overs) closed, Pakistan 263-9 innings closed.</p>
